{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼せっちゃーん／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんがいると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つい名前呼んじゃう♪楽しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさと写真撮ったとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真顔で「えっ？赤ちゃん...？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でもサンタ信じてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタになんかプレゼント頼んだ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの間にかプレゼントは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パパがくれるようになってるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！いるよ！きっといるんだよ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頼んでないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センター試験ムズカシス(汗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな俺はファン失格ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂センター試験。まりかは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当然、全問正解できたんよねー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、こんな個人的な問題..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勘で当てるしかないよ。難問だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、私は余裕で解けるけどねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ごめんなさいわかりません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニのスイーツで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついつい買っちゃうものある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苺のお菓子で、何が一番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近買ってないよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなのあるよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大福とか絶対美味..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って誘惑しないでよ～><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苺はどうやって食べるのが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま食べる？それとも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練乳や牛乳をかけたりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま派"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イラストの女の子はモデルいるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人物画って初めてブログにあげた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で書いたんですか!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想像で、ペンと色鉛筆で描いたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん最初はシャーペンで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人物画は初めて載せました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほめてくださって嬉しいわや～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また載せようかなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハズレ動画で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんず出てきて衝突してたけどw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの動画はどっちが考えたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、コントね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなくじゃましてみようかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで考えたらああなった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐだぐだだけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれが伊藤ちゃんずクオリティ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜寝れなかったの？大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配おかけしました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近掃除して部屋がきれいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいストーブ届いたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"椅子から動きたくなくて...←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読書好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近本読まないな...読みたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでるのは漫画と雑誌だけだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコケーキはチョコの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキだからで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズケーキはチーズの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキだからなのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでショートケーキは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苺なのにショートケーキ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...え、ええ？え？ん？お？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ(←理解した)それはね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苺ってストロベリーじゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前をストロベリーケーキにして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキ屋さんに並べても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキの前に置くプレートに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文字が入り切らないんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでショートかっていうとね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苺がちっちゃいからだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるかあああああい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"?!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかが使ってる絵文字"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいかわいいねぇ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこの絵文字教えて～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵文字屋っていうところのを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"保存してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエット中？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意識しないと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい食べちゃうから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いものはいくない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー！今日らりんにぎゅーしてない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんに抱きつきたい気持ち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着くんだよ。ぬーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンおつかれ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪もうのびた！切りたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒のニューヘアーがめっちゃすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとなでなでしてた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/15/8306932/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショートっていいな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は切らんけどなあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}